    {
      "text": "きょうじんな　しっぽを　はげしく\nふりはらって　あいてを　こうげきする。\nあいての　こうげきを　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "강인한 꼬리를 세차게\n휘둘러서 상대를 공격한다.\n상대의 공격을 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激烈地甩動強韌\n的尾巴攻擊對手，\n降低對手的攻擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur balaie violemment le camp adverse\navec son immense queue. Baisse l’Attaque de la cible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender schwingt heftig seinen robusten Schweif,\num damit gegnerische Pokémon anzugreifen und ihren\nAngriffs-Wert zu senken.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario sacude violentamente su enorme cola para\ngolpear a todos los rivales y reducir su Ataque a la par.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca i nemici intorno con la sua robusta\ncoda riducendone l’Attacco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user swings its tough tail wildly and attacks\nopposing Pokémon. This also lowers their Attack stats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きょうじんな　しっぽを　激しく\nふりはらって　相手を　攻撃する。\n相手の　攻撃を　下げる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用坚韧的尾巴\n猛扫对手进行攻击，\n从而降低对手的攻击。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
